# The worker loads the project-root ../.env first (shared with the Node proxy),
# then this voice/.env if present (overrides). You normally only need the root .env.
#
# STT/LLM/TTS all run through LiveKit Inference, so the ONLY credentials needed are:
# LIVEKIT_URL=wss://your-project.livekit.cloud
# LIVEKIT_API_KEY=...
# LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=...
